01:00:27.450 --> 01:00:34.400
<v Gavin Yamey>Lots of people wish that we would die. And lots of people wished that we would have a very slow death from a nasty cancer.
<v Gavin Yamey>很多人希望我们死。很多人希望我们缓慢地死于讨厌的癌症。

01:00:34.400 --> 01:00:49.730
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass, back next week with the second hour we're doing on health care. The Planet Money team takes on the insurance business right here on This American Life.
<v Ira Glass>我是艾拉·格拉斯，下周带着我们正在做的关于医疗保健的第二个小时回来。Planet Money团队在这里，《美国生活》中接管保险业务。

